{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103257","id":2354461653,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6MVjvV","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103257","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103257.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103257.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103257","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103257/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103257/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103257/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7df65de79603c872419aaedfbf6589c10ba80910","number":103257,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Condense Inspector layout for Arrays","user":{"login":"dugramen","id":54819319,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODE5MzE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54819319?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen","html_url":"https://github.com/dugramen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\nMostly implements https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10125\r\n\r\n- Merges `+ Add Element` button and size modifier into 1 row, and moves it to the bottom of the list\r\n- Moves array buttons & handles up to the property header, freeing up space in nested editors\r\n- Adds an Editor Setting to enable or disable condensing the buttons (in some cases the old uncondensed layout is a bit clearer)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/660d102d-c59c-4188-815f-f810cb7acb61)\r\n\r\n- Fixes an issue where dragged/reordered element's folded states were not updated, so the wrong items were unfolded / folded after the drag\r\n\r\n| Before | After |\r\n| --- | --- |\r\n| ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0686801f-0d00-4724-bd66-1b0ef0694e07) | ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2ce837c7-9204-41fb-bd04-f1f10c2e45dd) |\r\n\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Previous version</summary>\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/90fbcde1-f71a-4f8f-bd03-194130ae2eb5)\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nAlso things I might have to address if desired:\r\n- This doesn't affect dictionaries.\r\n- This doesn't change the Array / Resource button design, which passivestar's design does.\r\n- ~~This doesn't remove the Stylebox for the array buttons, which passivestars' design does.~~\r\n- ~~It might be good to have another Editor Setting to keep the size row at the top,~~\r\n\r\nEdit: Added array property's name to size label\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n\r\n~~<summary>Edit 2: Added setting for size controls to be at the top, bottom, or split like it was before:</summary>~~\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b3ea9a84-639e-45db-bfac-355c66c16255)\r\n| Top | Split |\r\n| --- | --- |\r\n| ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/029e44f0-fe09-451d-952a-464993834ae9) | ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/14e92d56-6ec1-4263-8843-9a8655e7ec95) |\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nEdit 3: Renamed the setting to \"embedded_list_buttons\". Embedded buttons are now flat, and array button labels have shorter text as per the proposal design. Moved the \"Add Element\" button to the top alongside the array header button, to allow adding elements from both the top and bottom. Changed the setting from edit 2 to a bool called \"condensed_size_controls_layout\", when disabled just uses the old size controls layout.\r\n\r\nEdit 4: fixed rtl layout","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repi